--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lines DemoBgf_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 24057f766373758429d9a953275f7374, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 33686114304
    m_Localized: Miss Lillian! How are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863040
    m_Localized: Good afternoon, Master Julian. I see no reason for complaints. What
      brings you here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863041
    m_Localized: Is this, perhaps, about the request you intend to make of me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863042
    m_Localized: "Oh. Bastian\u2019s already told you, then."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863043
    m_Localized: Mister Louissant, chivalrous as all gentlemen should aspire to be,
      did me the courtesy of anticipating the subject of our conversation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863044
    m_Localized: "Listen, Miss Lillian\u2026 I know you have some qualms about Cyrus,
      but I \u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863045
    m_Localized: Your fretting is unnecessary. I shall help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863046
    m_Localized: "No, Miss. Please, he is \u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863047
    m_Localized: "Wait, what did you just say? You\u2019re going to help me?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863048
    m_Localized: Does my kindness surprise you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863049
    m_Localized: I am a faithful worshipper of The Gleam, and evidently, excessively
      merciful as well. You may consider my actions retribution for your hospitality,
      if you wish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863050
    m_Localized: Furthermore, a lady of good faith is expected to partake in acts
      of charity, is she not? Even if the target of said charity is a vagabond, indolent
      person like Cyrus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863051
    m_Localized: Right. What do you need, then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863052
    m_Localized: Mister Louissant has offered me a handful of raspberries, and I
      always carry some daisy petals with me. I believe that, should you fetch me
      some Squid Ink, I would be able to prepare a concoction strong enough to cure
      any ailments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863053
    m_Localized: "Great! I\u2019ll come back with the Squid Ink soon!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863054
    m_Localized: 'I shall be waiting. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863055
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m really grateful. I mean it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863056
    m_Localized: 'Do not thank me yet, Master Julian. Do it after I cure your friend. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863057
    m_Localized: "Ink\u2026? And where can I find it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863058
    m_Localized: "Oh my\u2026 Wouldn\u2019t it be fortunate, were we close to a Great
      Squid\u2019s lair at this time and moment?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863059
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863060
    m_Localized: "Was\u2026 was that sarcasm\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863061
    m_Localized: "Mister Louissant has been teaching me such \u201Cfigure of speech\u201D.
      It might be considered terribly uncouth for a lady of my station to use it,
      but I cannot deny it has been remarkably useful. \n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863062
    m_Localized: "I see. Are you sure this \u2018concoction\u2019 will be enough?
      I\u2019ve never seen Cyrus in such a bad state before. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863063
    m_Localized: '[...] '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863064
    m_Localized: "No. I shall be direct with you. I have not been informed of the
      man\u2019s symptoms, nor may I be considered a renowned physician. I have cared
      for a few ladies and madams when the town was visited by the plague, but nothing
      beyond that. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863065
    m_Localized: "Oh. Well. You\u2019re the best we\u2019ve got at the moment, miss."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863066
    m_Localized: "In that case, you may inform me of your friend\u2019s condition."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863067
    m_Localized: "Well\u2026 He\u2019s been acting kind of weird for awhile now.
      He\u2019s been more\u2026 more intense, maybe. More reckless."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863068
    m_Localized: "Things got worse yesterday. It looks like he has a fever. He keeps
      tossing around in bed, mumbling gibberish. I\u2019m scared he\u2019s drunk
      or eaten something he shouldn\u2019t have."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863069
    m_Localized: Oh! Are you claiming the sinner has started to act as though he
      is a man possessed? Would that some kind soul had warned this about this possibility,
      huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863070
    m_Localized: "Miss Lillian\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863071
    m_Localized: "Forgive me, forgive me. But I have long since been censored for
      perceiving that man\u2019s hidden perversities! You have to understand my satisfaction
      that the signs I recognized have been brought to light at last. Wouldn\u2019t
      you agree?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863072
    m_Localized: Can you help him or not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863073
    m_Localized: "Certainly, Master Julian. The concoction shall work. Had you a
      child to care for, there would still be no better medicine to administer. The
      only thing it will not solve is Cyrus\u2019 guilty conscience. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863074
    m_Localized: Even so, I advise you to hide an old boot in his quarters and, if
      you are able to find it, tie a sprig of dried vervain above his doorframe.
      It would be prudent to protect ourselves against demons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863075
    m_Localized: Yeah, sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784566018048
    m_Localized: Julian, darling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795264
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 Hi Bastian. \u2018Everything\u2019s doing\u2019?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795265
    m_Localized: "I mean\u2013 How\u2013 How are you doing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795266
    m_Localized: "I\u2026 uh\u2026 I meant to say \u201Chow are you doing?\u201D,
      but then my mind went \u201Ceverything good?\u201D. You know how it is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795267
    m_Localized: Yes. I sure do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795268
    m_Localized: I reckon you've come to ask me to go after your Squid Ink, no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795269
    m_Localized: "I like to know what I\u2019m getting into, that\u2019s all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795270
    m_Localized: "Lillian mentioned you\u2019d already talked to her."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795271
    m_Localized: "Right. I\u2026 I think I would\u2019ve appreciated it if you'd
      talked to me first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795272
    m_Localized: "What for? I\u2019m the one who\u2019s going to fight the monster,
      anyway."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795273
    m_Localized: "Yeah. That\u2019s true. Well..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795274
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795275
    m_Localized: "\u2026Do you need anything else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795282
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 Squid Ink?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795283
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m\u2026 I\u2019m not sure I know what you\u2019re talking
      about."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795284
    m_Localized: "You haven\u2019t talked to Lillian today, have you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795285
    m_Localized: Not a problem. Lillian told me she can make Cyrus some medicine.
      She only needs some Squid Ink to do it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795286
    m_Localized: "Or at least that\u2019s what I think she said."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795287
    m_Localized: "Either way, I\u2019m willing to go save our boy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795288
    m_Localized: Oh. Of course. Thank you, then!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795289
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795290
    m_Localized: "\u2026Do you need anything else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795291
    m_Localized: Oh, I only wanted to get to know you a little better, sir.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795292
    m_Localized: "\u2026We\u2019re all in this together, after all. In this \u2018killing
      monsters\u2019, \u2018maybe dying\u2019 thing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795293
    m_Localized: '"Get to know me better", you say?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795294
    m_Localized: "Well, I\u2019m sorry to disappoint you, Julian. There\u2019s not
      much to tell you. I was unfortunately trained by the Merchant Guard, just for
      a while, and then I became a Privateer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795295
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m aware a lot of civilians \u2013 like yourself \u2013 think
      our lives are only adventure, drinking and women. Sometimes it is. But most
      of the time, we just confiscate stolen goods and return it to port."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795296
    m_Localized: "And how exactly did you become a Privateer? Did you always dream
      of hunting pirates or\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795297
    m_Localized: "Hah! No, that wasn\u2019t a dream of mine. Not at all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795298
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s just how things turned out for me, darling. That\u2019s
      all. I left the Academy and headed straight for the ocean because I couldn\u2019t
      stand being there anymore. Killing pirates was just a plus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795299
    m_Localized: Oh, but knowing you keep the seas safer must be comforting for you,
      no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795300
    m_Localized: 'Sure. If you say so. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
